# Main changes Changelog

## myAssistente5
Full compatibility with the *AIML standard* files using new aiml_parser.py
Integration with myAgenda, myTodo, myNote plugins
GUI: Collapsable command lists
*Windows* and *Linux* distributable package

## myAssistente4
AIML-like engine based on JSON files
Windows and Linux distributable package

## Assistente3
Optional connection with *external AI* (API key)
Release with multiplatform *STT /TTS VOICE functions* enabled
Windows and Linux distributable package
15 languages available

## Assistente2
Release with VOICE functions enabled (STT multiplatform, TTS only for windows)
Italian and English Language
Windows and Linux distributable package
distributed from GitLab, repository mirror only on GitHub

## Assistente1
First stable release
Italian Language only
Windows distributable package
distributed from GitHub

## Assistente0
test release
Italian Language only
Windows distributable package
